ord) (Filed on 10/3/2024) (Entered: 10/03/2024)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/404077562/", "id": 404077562, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/68868936/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/414499864/", "id": 414499864, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "/docket/68868936/23/epicrew-corporation-v-capital-asset-exchange-and-trading-llc/", "date_created": "2024-10-02T16:01:18.045390-07:00", "date_modified": "2025-06-04T09:32:37.235742-07:00", "sha1": "b4539f00673b138335d34e51a1cee385c5d99fb3", "page_count": 1, "file_size": 122722, "filepath_local": "recap/gov.uscourts.cand.431255/gov.uscourts.cand.431255.23.0.pdf", "filepath_ia": "https://archive.org/download/gov.uscourts.cand.431255/gov.uscourts.cand.431255.23.0.pdf", "ia_upload_failure_count": null, "thumbnail": null, "thumbnail_status": 0, "plain_text": "                                          Case 5:24-cv-03676-EJD Document 23 Filed 10/02/24 Page 1 of 1\n\n\n\n\n                                   1\n\n                                   2                                  UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT\n\n                                   3                                 NORTHERN DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA\n\n                                   4                                         SAN JOSE DIVISION\n\n                                   5\n\n                                   6     EPICREW USA,                                       Case No. 5:24-cv-03676-EJD\n                                                        Plaintiff,                          ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE\n                                   7\n                                                   v.\n                                   8\n\n                                   9     CAPITAL ASSET EXCHANGE AND\n                                         TRADING, LLC,\n                                  10                    Defendant.\n                                  11\n                                              Plaintiff Epicrew USA (\u201cEpicrew USA\u201d) brings this case against Defendant Capital Asset\n                                  12\n                                       Exchange and Trading, LLC (\u201cCAET\u201d) for breach of contract and other claims related to CAET\u2019s\nNorthern District of California\n United States District Court\n\n\n\n\n                                  13\n                                       alleged failure to perform under certain agreements. Epicrew asserts that jurisdiction in this Court\n                                  14\n                                       is proper pursuant to 28 U.S.C. \u00a7 1332(a) \u201cas the controversy is between a foreign citizen and a\n                                  15\n                                       U.S. citizen, and the amount in controversy exceeds $75,000, exclusive of interest and costs.\u201d\n                                  16\n                                       Complaint, ECF No. 1 \u00b6 6. However, the Complaint\u2019s caption page and the civil cover sheet\n                                  17\n                                       reflect that the case is brought on behalf of \u201cEpicrew USA\u201d which appears to be a company based\n                                  18\n                                       in Irvine, California. Id.; see also ECF No. 1-1 (emphasis added).\n                                  19\n                                              The Court hereby ORDERS Epicrew to show cause by October 3, 2024, why this case\n                                  20\n                                       should not be dismissed for lack of subject matter jurisdiction. Epicrew may submit a 3-page\n                                  21\n                                       response before the hearing on CAET\u2019s motion to dismiss scheduled for October 3, 2024 at\n                                  22\n                                       9:00 A.M.\n                                  23\n                                              IT IS SO ORDERED.\n                                  24\n                                       Dated: October 2, 2024\n                                  25\n\n                                  26                                                               EDWARD J. DAVILA\n                                                                                                   United States District Judge\n                                  27\n\n                                  28   Case No.: 5:24-cv-03676-EJD\n                                       ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE\n                                                                                        1\n\f", "ocr_status": 2, "date_upload": "2024-10-03T01:43:13.684231-07:00", "document_number": "23", "attachment_number": null, "pacer_doc_id": "035024942044", "is_available": true, "is_free_on_pacer": true, "is_sealed": null, "document_type": 1, "description": "Order to Show Cause", "acms_document_guid": ""}], "date_created": "2024-10-02T16:01:18.031040-07:00", "date_modified": "2025-06-04T09:32:37.216286-07:00", "date_filed": "2024-10-02", "time_filed": "15:51:26", "entry_number": 23, "recap_sequence_number": "2024-10-02.001", "pacer_sequence_number": 61, "description": "ORDER TO SHOW CAUSE. Response due by 10/3/2024. Signed by Judge Edward J. Davila on 10/2/2024. (ejdlc1, COURT STAFF) (Filed on 10/2/2024) (Entered: 10/02/2024)", "tags": []}, {"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/docket-entries/402450267/", "id": 402450267, "docket": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/dockets/68868936/", "recap_documents": [{"resource_uri": "https://www.courtlistener.com/api/rest/v4/recap-documents/412256145/", "id": 412256145, "tags": [], "absolute_url": "", "date_created": "2024-09-16T16:32:16.602991-07:00", "date_modifie